OL,3,AZambia's president to be sworn in for
OL,4,Asecond term while opponent detained
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was unable to mount a legal
OL,7,Fchallenge to the result as the courts
OL,8,Fwere sealed off last week on the final
OL,9,Fday a case could be filed.
OL,11,FElection observers said that while
OL,12,Fpolling day was largely peaceful, some
OL,13,Fhave raised questions about the vote
OL,14,Ftallying process.
